@@ -2202,6 +2202,10 @@ Update one controller setting:
 
 `discoverable` and `connectable` can also be supplied as booleans. Enabling
 the controller is explicit and is limited to one activation attempt per boot.
+Because the kernel refuses inquiry scan while page scan is off, enabling
+`discoverable` also enables `connectable`. Disabling `discoverable` while the
+controller is not connectable succeeds without a controller command, since it
+is already not visible.
 
 #### POST /api/v1/bluetooth/pairing-mode
 
